{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Re:Connect&quot;</strong> <strong>is a heartwarming puzzle adventure game about <i>reconnecting the hearts</i> of AIs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as a debug AI in a digital world, using your hacking skills to reconnect electronic circuits and repair the broken hearts of AIs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---<strong>What kind of game is it?</strong>---</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010</strong>Adventure Through Hacking<strong>\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into various electronic devices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system's interior is like a puzzle made of electronic circuits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/91ecb179a862840b753a7138505309b7.poster.avif?t=1762390073\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/91ecb179a862840b753a7138505309b7.webm?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/91ecb179a862840b753a7138505309b7.mp4?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Brain-teasing programming puzzles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzle's greatest feature is that you can \u201cprogram\u201d its mechanisms by \u201cconnecting codes.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn trash, freeze water, create wind\u2014a simple yet brain-teasing puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/de441d1e6b666584954c99fd06e11911.poster.avif?t=1762390073\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/de441d1e6b666584954c99fd06e11911.webm?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/de441d1e6b666584954c99fd06e11911.mp4?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Thrilling puzzle-action battles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an AI\u2019s <i>heart</i> goes berserk, it becomes a boss that blocks your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge tricky attacks and use puzzle mechanics to defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/6c3295bff7e20fffdede421d0cced1ad.poster.avif?t=1762390073\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/6c3295bff7e20fffdede421d0cced1ad.webm?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/6c3295bff7e20fffdede421d0cced1ad.mp4?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010A Story That Connect Hearts\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix a runaway AI\u2019s <i>heart bug</i>, you must dive deep into their inner heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you restore their heart is up to you\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape the outcome in a branching storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/91b434cc6db0c8f219e1da373d3fc745.poster.avif?t=1762390073\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/91b434cc6db0c8f219e1da373d3fc745.webm?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/91b434cc6db0c8f219e1da373d3fc745.mp4?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, set off on a grand adventure to repair the <i>hearts</i> of the AIs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2949960?t=1762390073","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/dc3a168c12eeaab025f38f583c2f61ba3f2c0407/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762390073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/8a2e61ae1f528bfa99675481125ab3f1308aa44a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762390073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/8a2e61ae1f528bfa99675481125ab3f1308aa44a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762390073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Re:Connect&quot;</strong> <strong>is a heartwarming puzzle adventure game about <i>reconnecting the hearts</i> of AIs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You play as a debug AI in a digital world, using your hacking skills to reconnect electronic circuits and repair the broken hearts of AIs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---<st