1762390073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Thrilling puzzle-action battles\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an AI\u2019s <i>heart</i> goes berserk, it becomes a boss that blocks your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge tricky attacks and use puzzle mechanics to defeat them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/6c3295bff7e20fffdede421d0cced1ad.poster.avif?t=1762390073\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/6c3295bff7e20fffdede421d0cced1ad.webm?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/6c3295bff7e20fffdede421d0cced1ad.mp4?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010A Story That Connect Hearts\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix a runaway AI\u2019s <i>heart bug</i>, you must dive deep into their inner heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you restore their heart is up to you\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape the outcome in a branching storyline!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/91b434cc6db0c8f219e1da373d3fc745.poster.avif?t=1762390073\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/91b434cc6db0c8f219e1da373d3fc745.webm?t=1762390073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta